# /etc/cron.d/deliverability-digest
# Raise My Presence — Daily Deliverability Digest
#
# Managed by RMP-2 deploy workflow. Edit canonical source in vault at:
#   Local-Presence-Optimization/src/pipeline/deliverability-digest
# Never edit /etc/cron.d/deliverability-digest directly on Tencent.
#
# Created RMP #46, 2026-05-23.
#
# Schedule (system local time = CST/UTC+8 — cron uses system local, NOT UTC):
#   09:00 CST → 01:00 UTC → 08:00 Bangkok (operator timezone)
#
# Fires deliverability_digest.py daily; queries SendGrid Stats + suppression
# endpoints + HetrixTools blacklist API + Postmark DMARC digest (Gmail API);
# renders HTML+plain-text digest and SendGrid-sends to operator inbox
# (odedmarketing@gmail.com).
#
# Covers Surfaces 3/4/5/7 from email-health-audit-runbook.md:
#   3. SendGrid spam complaint rate (14d rolling)
#   4. Suppression list WoW growth (7-day rolling baseline — RMP #46 patch)
#   5. HetrixTools blacklist monitor — domain + IP across ~23 RBLs (Pillar B-1, RMP #50; replaced Postmaster v1)
#   6. DEPRECATED — Postmaster v1 IP reputation surface EOL'd by Google, no v2 replacement (RMP #50)
#   7. Postmark DMARC authentication health — Gmail-polled weekly digest (Pillar B-2, RMP #51)
#
# Surfaces 1/2/8/9 are covered separately by alert_on_failure.py volume-floor
# alerter + per-market cron log structure.
#
# MAILTO="" disables cron's default mail-on-output behavior.
# Script-side failures (non-zero exit) log to /var/log/rmp-cron/deliverability-digest.log.
#
# Rollback: comment out the cron line below.
# Full removal: rm /etc/cron.d/deliverability-digest on Tencent.
#
# File format: standard /etc/cron.d/ system cron (user field required between
# timing and command). Must be mode 644, owned by root, no extension.

MAILTO=""
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# Daily digest — 09:00 server local = 08:00 Bangkok
0 9 * * * root cd /root/audit-scanner/pipeline && python3 deliverability_digest.py >> /var/log/rmp-cron/deliverability-digest.log 2>&1
